### Extension "REST Client" (humao.rest-client) : cliquer sur "Send Request"
### Récupérer un token Keycloak puis le coller ici
@token = COLLE_TON_JWT_ICI
@host = http://localhost:8081

### Créer un profil (le keycloakId est pris dans le sub du JWT)
POST {{host}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Aymen",
  "lastName": "Test",
  "email": "aymen@test.com",
  "phone": "21612345678",
  "preferences": "{\"lang\":\"fr\",\"notifications\":true}"
}

### Consulter un profil
GET {{host}}/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ajouter un véhicule
POST {{host}}/api/users/1/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plateNumber": "123 TUN 4567",
  "brand": "Peugeot",
  "model": "208",
  "color": "Gris"
}

### Lister les véhicules
GET {{host}}/api/users/1/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Validation du conducteur (appel de MS4)
GET {{host}}/api/users/keycloak/REMPLACE_PAR_SUB/validation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Désactiver un compte (ADMIN)
PATCH {{host}}/api/users/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "active": false }
